    answer: "Yes. Room and food are taxed separately. In hotels where room tariffs stay at or below ₹7,500, in-house restaurant service is generally taxed at 5% without input tax credit; in 'specified premises' (where a room crossed ₹7,500), it is 18% with input tax credit."
